    {
      "post": {
        "id": "1133926198902926",
        "type": "regular",
        "url": "https://www.facebook.com/100068566698318/posts/1133926198902926",
        "feedback_id": "ZmVlZGJhY2s6MTEzMzkyNjE5ODkwMjkyNg==",
        "id_source": "post_id",
        "text": "🧠 December 10 — Human Rights Day\n\nEmpowering Every Voice. Protecting Every Right.\n\nToday we celebrate Human Rights Day — reminding us that dignity, equality, and respect belong to everyone, including those with disabilities and mental health challenges.\n\n💙 We advocate for:\n✔ Equal healthcare access\n✔ Inclusive disability support\n✔ Mental health without stigma\n✔ Fair opportunities for all\n\nLet’s stand together for human rights — today and every day.\n\n📧 info@evermedics.com\n📞 +18338076669\n🌐 evermedics.com\n\n#HumanRightsDay #MentalHealthAwareness #DisabilityRights #HealthcareForAll #EverMedics #InclusionMatters #equalityforall #evermedics",
        "hashtags": [
          "#HumanRightsDay",
          "#MentalHealthAwareness",
          "#DisabilityRights",
          "#HealthcareForAll",
          "#EverMedics",
          "#InclusionMatters",
